          %p Notice that (as verified by direct unwinding of the definitions):
          .num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_3 Lemma
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
