          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              On representatives as in the proof of (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+1-2#HomotopyGroupsOfHomotopyCommutativeRingSpectrum"}> this propo.
