          .proof
            %h6#proof_5 Proof
            %p
              One observes that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %mo ∧
                    %mi E
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E \wedge E
              satisfies the axioms of a commutative Hopf algebroid object in homotopy commutative ring spectra, over
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
