              by the group corresponding to the result of chopping off the lowest dot, which however in this case does not change the figure.)
            %p
              Indeed, by lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#pAdicIntegersAspExtensionofFpByThemselves"}
              below we have a short exact sequence
            .maruku-equation
