                    \\,.
            %p
              Together this implies, by
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+S#lim1AndExt1"} this lemma
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} short exact sequence
              of the form
            .maruku-equation
