                      %mrow
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mn 2
                    %mo +
                    %msubsup
                      %mi h
                      %mrow
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mn 1
                      %mn 3
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d_2(b_{2,n}) = h_n^2 h_{n+2} + h_{n+1}^3
              means that on the third page of the May spectral sequence there is an identification
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
